# §3.4.1 reads Ge'ez numerals; ወደ_ግዕዝ writes them, so a program can show a
# number in Amharic's own numerals and not only accept them (§8.7).
# expect: ፩
# expect: ፳፩
# expect: ፫፻፳፩
# expect: ፻
# expect: ፼
# expect: ፪፼
# expect: እውነት
ጻፍ(ወደ_ግዕዝ(1))
ጻፍ(ወደ_ግዕዝ(21))
ጻፍ(ወደ_ግዕዝ(321))

# A leading 1 before a separator is left out, because an empty group before a
# separator reads as 1 (§3.4.1).
ጻፍ(ወደ_ግዕዝ(100))
ጻፍ(ወደ_ግዕዝ(10000))
ጻፍ(ወደ_ግዕዝ(20000))

# The two directions must agree.
ጻፍ(ወደ_ቁጥር(ወደ_ግዕዝ(4567)) == 4567)
